=2 Walkthrough
* After talking to the Campaign Ops NPC, you are to scour South San d'Oria (S) for a clickable point called "Suspicious Object". You must collect five of them to complete the mission.
* The Suspicious Object seems to spawn anywhere in South San d'Oria (S) and once someone touches it, it disappears immediately.
* More than one Suspicious object can appear at a time.
* The Suspicious Object respawns immediately in a different location. So far the point can appear at:

:* (E-7) - By the {p:??? Warmachine}.
:* (F-6)
:* (F-9)
:* (G-9) - On the ramp in front of Westgate or on the wall by {n:Aurfet}.
:* (I-9)
:* (J-9) - near {n:Voucheramme}.
:* (K-8)
:* (K-9) Top Middle of stairs near E.Ronf exit.
:* (K-9) Stairway to top level.
:* (K-10) - near {n:Chauxnatte} and {n:Alfred}.
:* (L-7) Where Goblin box would be in present day.
:* (L-9)
:* (M-5) Next to Porter Moogle
:* (M-7)

* After obtaining the object, you will obtain experience points and get a message that you quota has been met. After this occurs, go back to the Campaign Ops NPC and collect your Allied Notes.

=2 Notes
* You must have the Golden Star S S S S__ to access this Campaign Op.__

